DISCLAIMER

SmallSky is an unofficial, independent, student-built tool. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or otherwise connected to
De La Salle-College of Saint Benilde, D2L Corporation, the Brightspace
platform, or any of their affiliates. "BigSky" refers to Benilde's
deployment of D2L Brightspace; SmallSky is a third-party reader of
data that BigSky already exposes to its logged-in users.

SmallSky may display inaccurate, incomplete, stale, or out-of-date
information. Possible causes include caching delays, network errors,
unannounced changes to BigSky's APIs, and ordinary bugs in this
software. The author maintains the codebase but does not — and cannot
— guarantee that what SmallSky displays matches BigSky's authoritative
state at any given moment.

You, the user, are solely responsible for verifying anything that
matters — assignment submissions, deadlines, grades, announcements,
calendar events, and any other academic information — using BigSky's
official interface before relying on it. The author accepts no
responsibility, financial or otherwise, for missed assignments, late
submissions, incorrect grades, lost work, academic penalties,
disciplinary outcomes, or any direct, indirect, incidental, or
consequential loss arising from your use of, or inability to use, this
software.

By installing, running, or distributing SmallSky, you acknowledge that
you have read and accepted this disclaimer.

